++++++++++++++```
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++MySQL now uses `JSON NOT NULL` for JSON-array-backed fields, while SQLite keeps `JSON DEFAULT '[]' NOT NULL`. The same helper is used for multiple select, relation, and file fields.
